        "value": "The review addresses the question of how the gut microbiome impacts the efficacy and toxicity of cancer immunotherapies, aiming to consolidate preclinical and clinical evidence to understand the rationale for microbiome-targeted therapies and identify gaps in current knowledge regarding predictive biomarkers and mechanistic pathways.",
